{
  "name": "Esports Briefing Bot",
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "esports-briefing-bot-v1",
    "description": "Telegram command bot wired to the esports-data parser API on Render. Implements /rank, /team and /compare. Exported from n8n Cloud 1.78.x (2026-04). On older n8n the Switch and Merge node typeVersions may need to be lowered (Switch 3 -> 2, Merge 3 -> 2). Anthropic calls go via raw HTTP Request to api.anthropic.com to avoid pinning to any specific Anthropic node version.\n\nRequired n8n Cloud env variables (Settings -> Variables):\n  ESPORTS_API_BASE       e.g. https://esports-data-xxxx.onrender.com\n  TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID       your numeric chat id\n  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY      sk-ant-...\n\nRequired credentials (Credentials tab):\n  Telegram        bot   - Telegram bot token from @BotFather\n  HTTP Header Auth parser-api - header name 'Authorization', value 'Bearer <API_TOKEN>'"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [200, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "bot"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "REPLACE_AT_IMPORT"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose"},
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "auth-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $env.TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID }}",
              "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Auth filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [420, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const text = ($input.item.json.message?.text || '').trim();\nconst m = text.match(/^\\/([a-z]+)(?:\\s+(.*))?$/i);\nif (!m) {\n  return [{ json: { command: 'help', raw_args: '', args: [], chat_id: $input.item.json.message.chat.id } }];\n}\nconst [, cmd, rest = ''] = m;\nconst args = rest.trim().split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    command: cmd.toLowerCase(),\n    raw_args: rest.trim(),\n    args,\n    chat_id: $input.item.json.message.chat.id,\n    user_name: $input.item.json.message.from.username || $input.item.json.message.from.first_name\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Parse command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [640, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {"conditions": {"options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose"}, "conditions": [{"id": "r-rank", "leftValue": "={{ $json.command }}", "rightValue": "rank", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "rank"},
            {"conditions": {"options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose"}, "conditions": [{"id": "r-team", "leftValue": "={{ $json.command }}", "rightValue": "team", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "team"},
            {"conditions": {"options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose"}, "conditions": [{"id": "r-cmp", "leftValue": "={{ $json.command }}", "rightValue": "compare", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "compare"}
          ]
        },
        "options": {"fallbackOutput": "extra", "renameFallbackOutput": "help"}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Switch by command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [860, 320]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/rankings",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "GET /hltv/rankings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 80],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "x-api-key", "value": "={{ $env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"},
            {"name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01"},
            {"name": "content-type", "value": "application/json"}
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 600,\n  \"system\": \"You are a concise CS esports analyst. Summarise the input JSON into a Telegram post: 5 bullets max, Markdown, no preamble.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"HLTV top 30 right now:\\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.rankings.slice(0, 10)) }}\"}\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {"timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Claude format (rank)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.content[0].text }}",
        "additionalFields": {"parse_mode": "Markdown"}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Telegram reply (rank)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1580, 80],
      "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID", "name": "bot"}}
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/team/search",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "name", "value": "={{ $json.args[0] }}"}]},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020",
      "name": "GET team search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 320],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hits = $input.item.json.results || [];\nif (!hits.length) {\n  return [{ json: { error: `team \"${$('Parse command').item.json.args[0]}\" not found` } }];\n}\nconst pick = hits[0];\nconst monthsBack = parseInt($('Parse command').item.json.args[1] || '3', 10);\nreturn [{ json: { team_id: pick.team_id, slug: pick.slug, team_name: pick.team, months_back: monthsBack } }];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021",
      "name": "Pick team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1280, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/team/{{ $json.team_id }}/{{ $json.slug }}/overview",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "months_back", "value": "={{ $json.months_back }}"}]},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022",
      "name": "GET team overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1460, 320],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "x-api-key", "value": "={{ $env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"},
            {"name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01"},
            {"name": "content-type", "value": "application/json"}
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 500,\n  \"system\": \"You are a concise CS esports analyst. Summarise the team's window snapshot into a 3-bullet Telegram post in Markdown. No preamble.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\"}\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {"timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000023",
      "name": "Claude format (team)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1640, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.content[0].text }}",
        "additionalFields": {"parse_mode": "Markdown"}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000024",
      "name": "Telegram reply (team)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1820, 320],
      "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID", "name": "bot"}}
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/team/search",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "name", "value": "={{ $json.args[0] }}"}]},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 60000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000030",
      "name": "GET team search (compare)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 580],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hits = $input.item.json.results || [];\nif (!hits.length) {\n  return [{ json: { error: 'team not found' } }];\n}\nconst pick = hits[0];\nconst pivot = $('Parse command').item.json.args[1];\nif (!/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(pivot || '')) {\n  return [{ json: { error: 'usage: /compare <team> <YYYY-MM-DD>' } }];\n}\nconst d = new Date(pivot);\nconst minus3 = new Date(d); minus3.setMonth(minus3.getMonth() - 3);\nconst plus3 = new Date(d); plus3.setMonth(plus3.getMonth() + 3);\nconst iso = (x) => x.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    team_id: pick.team_id,\n    slug: pick.slug,\n    team_name: pick.team,\n    pivot,\n    before_start: iso(minus3),\n    before_end: iso(new Date(d.getTime() - 86400000)),\n    after_start: iso(d),\n    after_end: iso(plus3)\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031",
      "name": "Build windows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1280, 580]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/team/{{ $json.team_id }}/{{ $json.slug }}/maps",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {"parameters": [
          {"name": "start_date", "value": "={{ $json.before_start }}"},
          {"name": "end_date", "value": "={{ $json.before_end }}"}
        ]},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 90000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000032",
      "name": "Pull BEFORE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1460, 500],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.ESPORTS_API_BASE }}/hltv/team/{{ $('Build windows').item.json.team_id }}/{{ $('Build windows').item.json.slug }}/maps",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {"parameters": [
          {"name": "start_date", "value": "={{ $('Build windows').item.json.after_start }}"},
          {"name": "end_date", "value": "={{ $('Build windows').item.json.after_end }}"}
        ]},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "json"}}, "timeout": 90000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000033",
      "name": "Pull AFTER",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1460, 660],
      "credentials": {"httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "REPLACE_PARSER_CRED_ID", "name": "parser-api"}}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "x-api-key", "value": "={{ $env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"},
            {"name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01"},
            {"name": "content-type", "value": "application/json"}
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 800,\n  \"system\": \"You are a concise CS esports analyst. Given two HLTV per-map snapshots for the same team, compute the deltas and write a 4-bullet Telegram post in Markdown. Bullets: overall winrate delta, biggest CT-side delta with map name, biggest T-side delta with map name, one content angle. No preamble.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Team: {{ $('Build windows').item.json.team_name }}\\nPivot: {{ $('Build windows').item.json.pivot }}\\nBEFORE ({{ $('Build windows').item.json.before_start }} to {{ $('Build windows').item.json.before_end }}): {{ JSON.stringify($('Pull BEFORE').item.json) }}\\nAFTER ({{ $('Build windows').item.json.after_start }} to {{ $('Build windows').item.json.after_end }}): {{ JSON.stringify($('Pull AFTER').item.json) }}\"}\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {"timeout": 90000}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034",
      "name": "Claude format (compare)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1700, 580]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.content[0].text }}",
        "additionalFields": {"parse_mode": "Markdown"}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035",
      "name": "Telegram reply (compare)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1900, 580],
      "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID", "name": "bot"}}
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "Commands:\n/rank\n/team <name> [months_back]\n/compare <team> <YYYY-MM-DD>",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000040",
      "name": "Telegram help",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1100, 880],
      "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID", "name": "bot"}}
    }
  ],
